l,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-09T07:49:59Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T16:47:41Z","closed_at":"2026-08-11T16:46:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122222","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122222.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122222.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-11T16:46:20Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nExcessive `TextEdit` redraws when holding down the mouse, which aren't expensive, but not dirt cheap (around 1 ms on my mid-range laptop for an average GDScript)\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1005\" height=\"589\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4010ea55-23ae-4a7d-a42d-8de0c77cf519\" />\r\n\r\nThe functions `set_caret_line`, `set_selection_origin_column`, ... queue a redraw when they change something, and `_selection_changed` always forces a redraw (called when selection is enabled/disabled). So the `select` function itself doesn't change anything and thus doesn't require a redraw.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"716\" height=\"148\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5844c74-b9b5-4e1c-9691-e67618e8f18f\" />\r\n\r\n~Only redraw when the value changes, I think it's pretty self-explanatory.~\r\nEDIT: See review by kit for more info.\r\n\r\n## Before (look at the output/console)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a37c015c-6341-44fd-95d3-36443bfb626e\r\n\r\n## After (look at the output/console)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bfde827f-32a5-45eb-96ce-873fdc9f2f3a\r\n\r\n## Additional info\r\n\r\nDidn't see any behavioral changes in my testing.\r\n\r\nEDIT: the PR number is funny 122222","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followin